<p> BORROWER   KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON  ** 4.125     MATURITY    30.JUN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.995   PAY DATE    20.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.125     LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p>NOTES  **CALL AT PAR ON 30.DEC.97, WHEN COUPON STEPS UP TO 5.125 PCT  </p>
